<title>MALAYSIA: Malayawata Steel shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Malayawata Steel shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Malaysia's Malayawata Steel Bhd have been suspended at the company's request, a Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange official said on Monday.</p>
<p>Shares of the integrated steel company were last traded on Monday at 4.80 ringgit, up 32 cents.  </p>
<p>Officials at the company could not be immediately contacted.</p>
<p>Malayawata is a subsidiary of recently-restructured Pernas International Holdings Bhd, a hotels and property group.</p>
